\\ t4.gp: unconditional decision for the tier-4 d (fundamental, M(d) <= N) of isieve: classno_upto(d, N) of
\\ cln-imq-2k v1.4 qsieve/postproc.gp (Kimura, Apache-2.0): the subgroup generated by the prime forms of norm
\\ <= sqrt(d/3), built until it has N+1 elements (h > N) or the primes run out (h = its order).
\\ Run: awk '{print $1}' runs/x.t4 > runs/x.t4d; D4=runs/x.t4d N=5000 gp -q -f t4.gp < /dev/null
NO_RUN = 1;
read("cln-imq-2k-1.4/qsieve/postproc.gp");
D4 = getenv("D4"); NN = eval(getenv("N"));
v = readvec(D4);
nf = 0; for(i = 1, #v, my(r = classno_upto(v[i], NN)); if(r <= NN, nf++; print("FOUND ", v[i], " ", r)));
print("T4 DONE ", D4, ": entries ", #v, ", fields with h <= ", NN, ": ", nf);
